        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Zheng Jie, Jamie Hampton, Maria Kirilenko, Elena Bovina\n- Events: 2013 ASB Classic – Singles, 2011 Mercury Insurance Open – Doubles\n- Roles: defending champion, professional tennis player\n\nFacts:\n- Zheng Jie was born on 5 July 1983.\n- Zheng Jie is a Chinese professional tennis player.\n- At the 2011 Mercury Insurance Open – Doubles, Maria Kirilenko and Zheng Jie were the defending champions, but only Zheng Jie participated, partnering with Elena Bovina.\n- At the 2013 ASB Classic – Singles, Zheng Jie was the defending champion, but she lost in the first round to Jamie Hampton.",
